<SiteLayout title="SYSA City Tournament">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Postseason · U11–U19</p><h1>SYSA City Tournament</h1><p>A Seattle recreational soccer tradition since 1969.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>More soccer after the regular season</h2><p>The SYSA City Tournament uses a modified double-elimination format, giving participating U11 and older recreational teams at least two additional games. Many early-round games take place in the evening on lighted fields.</p><p>Teams should review SYSA's tournament guidance before registering, including scheduling and guest-player rules.</p><p><a class="btn" href="https://www.sysa.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tournament information at SYSA ↗</a></p></div></section>
